"entity": {
"name": "NCR Atleos Corporation",
"description": "NCR Atleos Corp. engages in the provision of custom computer programming services. It operates under the following segments: Self-Service Banking, Network, and Telecommunications and Technology. The Self-Service Banking segment includes financial solutions such as ATM hardware and software, installation, maintenance, and managed and professional services. The Network segment offers a network of ATMs and multi-functioning financial services kiosks. The Telecommunications and Technology Segment covers managed network and infrastructure services to enterprise clients. The company was founded in 1884 and is headquartered in Atlanta, GA.",
